// Crafting recipes. A craft job consumes the inputs from a public store and puts the
// outputs back into the same store (both logged in the ledger). Jobs are created on
// demand: construction sites short of an item, stock targets per resident, or arms for
// the soldiers a polity wants.
//   ticks: work per batch at average skill; station: building def that speeds it up.
//   group: within a group (tool / weapon / armor) only the best available recipe is
//          made for stock targets, so a bronze-age village stops knapping stone axes.
//   stock_per_resident: keep this many per resident in public stores.
//   military: keep one per wanted soldier.
